  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at part heading for He-E 801) #9969, eff 8-8-11; ss by #12830, INTERIM, eff 8-7-19, EXPIRED: 2-3-20 New. #13340, eff 1-29-22 (formerly He-E 801.11)",
